WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.690
Master! Where are you, Master?

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.740
Faceless. Shirogane.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.950
Mr. Masaru, run!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.580
Let go of Shirogane!

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.790
Good for you. You found Éléonore.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.670
Not that you can do anything.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.760
Lay one finger on Mr. Masaru,
and you will pay!

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.340
Masaru did pretty well.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.390
He beat those android-Os.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.770
I agree. He's done an admirable job.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.940
All out of your love for Éléonore, eh?

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.860
Why should I answer you?

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.320
But I will save Shirogane.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.610
I see.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.400
Then you will die here.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.110
You go ahead and take Éléonore.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.370
As you wish.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.200
-Mr. Masaru!
-Hold on, I'm coming!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.630
Now then, let's begin.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:23.350
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.600
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:32.150
All I want is to be with those I love

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:38.240
Ready or not
Here I come

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:42.040
I don't care anymore

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.830
I just don't know anymore

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:48.330
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.380
There are days when I think like that

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.050
But everything is precious to me

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:57.140
And so I fight on

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:00.680
Today was a tough day

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.770
I almost gave up hope

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:09.810
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:13.360
I wish everything would just disappear

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.780
There are days when I think like that

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.530
But everything is precious to me

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.660
And so I must fight

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:39.680
#27 Download

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.480
Master!

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.980
It's Arlequin.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.110
-I found it when I was looking for you.
-Thanks.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.200
Arlequin!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:02:59.780
Let's go.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.240
Go!

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.970
Where am I?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.180
A rocket?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:33.520
Lord Faceless is going to ride in it.
Together with Lady Francine.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.480
With Shirogane?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.530
But, where to?

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.410
480 km above Earth.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:46.200
To a man-made star that has been
repurposed by Lord Faceless.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.830
Or so I heard.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.870
You mean, a space station?

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.790
I have to let them know!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.590
Why did I tell her?

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:01.220
Is it because of that smile?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:12.810
There is a giant space station
being built in Earth's orbit.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.360
It's called Alpha.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.740
The US, Japan, European countries,
Canada and Russia

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.370
are collaborating on a joint project.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:30.750
But we've lost contact with
the six astronauts constructing it.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.790
And ZONAPHA struck the entire world
right after that.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:35.880
Right.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:40.130
Powerful electric waves
were emitted towards Earth from it.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.470
I'm analyzing them right now.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:48.430
But I believe those waves
are what control the ZONAPHA bugs.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.930
Then you do what you can about that.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.190
-Are you going?
-Yeah.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:58.570
Pantalone said Éléonore was being taken
to Mont Saint-Michel.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.110
It may be a trap.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.780
How long will it take for you
to mass-produce Harry?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.080
About three years.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.460
And they'll all die waiting.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.500
The children first.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.340
I can't sit around waiting for that.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:32.180
It's no use.
I can't fight three automata at once.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:37.360
What's wrong?
Have you run out of steam already?

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.570
But I have to fight.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.230
Swirling Tiger!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.320
No, you can't spin!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:46.740
Damn it.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.000
Stop it.
Masaru doesn't like you to do that.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.920
You're going to disobey me?

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:03.460
Yes, I am. Because Masaru held me.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.130
-You can move?
-Yes.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:06.630
I'm fine now.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:11.220
I'll take that little girl on,
so you go save your lady.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.270
All for love, right?

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.610
Rip her apart, my little teddies!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:23.280
No, I don't want to be ripped apart.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.700
Not so fast.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:29.660
Masaru!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.700
You came, Lise.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:37.120
Damn it.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.500
-Where's Shirogane?
-She was taken upstairs.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.550
Hurry, you must go save her.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:46.630
-Faceless means to take her to space.
-What?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.470
Go on now. Leave them to us.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.390
-You're...?
-Yes, I'm an automaton.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.890
But I'm on Masaru's side now.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.690
Hey, over here Colombine!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.450
Go on, save her!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.030
No, I can't leave you all fighting here.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.410
No, you must go to fight.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.000
To save Shirogane and go home.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.080
For all of us to go home.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:21.880
Hurry!

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.000
Thanks, Lise.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.260
Let's all go home together!

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:33.640
Where's the rocket?
Is it on a higher floor?

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:47.190
Finally, we're all alone.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.570
Faceless!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:55.990
The elevator behind me
leads right to the rocket Éléonore is on.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.210
Beat me if you want to reach it.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:04.420
-Dismantle.
-Swirling Tiger!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.250
I'll get his legs.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.460
Dismantle!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.680
That was close.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:15.720
I see, we know each other's moves.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.270
What is he going to do to me
with this rocket?

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:31.240
You're going to a nice space station
for your honeymoon.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.570
With Lord Faceless.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.200
Impossible, I would never!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.790
Even if I do, I will break the rocket
with him in it.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:44.920
Do it if you can, then.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.290
-What?
-Oops, sorry.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:51.220
But you see, you won't do that.

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:55.590
I'll bet you a cat's tail that you won't.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.350
-Swirling Tiger!
-Dismantle.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.100
-Damn it.
-Ha!

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:00.100
Dismantle!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:05.520
Not bad. I'll have to step up my game.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.900
Here, take a look inside.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.860
It's the latest download system.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:17.780
This time, it won't even take 10 minutes
to download me into you.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.450
You still haven't given that up?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:26.880
Countdown in progress.
42 minutes 30 seconds until lift-off.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.800
That's more than enough time
to perform a download.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:36.800
I will be bound together with Shirogane
in your body.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.600
Faceless is too strong.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.220
I can't win that quickly.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:47.350
Even if I do win, I might not have
enough time to save Shirogane.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.360
What should I do? What can I do?

00:09:52.530 --> 00:10:05.000
Master!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.420
Oh no...

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.590
Master, Master!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.720
Too bad, Gryphon.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.640
He can't hear you now.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:27.480
I'm Guri-pon, now.
That's what Master calls me. Let him go!

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.230
No can do.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.650
Stay there and watch your master
become me.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.820
Commence the download.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:50.330
No, wake up Master!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:11:00.140
It's much too loud here
for our little fight.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:06.100
Yes, I was just thinking your remains
would look better in the ocean.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:10.230
You're on. Let's take this outside.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.360
Follow me.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.390
Master...?

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.770
What is it, Gryphon?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.820
What is it, Gryphon?

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:02.570
Faceless's brain is inside him now...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:07.450
It's all over... He isn't Master anymore.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.290
No, that's not true Guri-pon.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:12.580
It's me, Masaru.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.470
He really is Faceless...

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:28.060
It's a strange feeling,
having two of myself exist.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.930
Time to start the show.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:35.770
We're going to put on a great one
for Éléonore.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:36.980
Right, me?

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:41.820
I can't wait, me in my old body.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.660
What are you two up to?

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.580
I and I are going to head up
to our heroine.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.120
Who is, of course, Éléonore.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.960
Poor Éléonore is tied to a seat
in the rocket.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.420
I and I will appear in front of her,
fighting.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.880
Shirogane!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.430
Masaru, you will die here.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.970
-Éléonore is mine!
-Mr. Masaru!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:15.480
I will make sure Éléonore believes that
I haven't downloaded myself into Masaru.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:19.570
And Masaru will lunge at me.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.280
No!

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:24.610
Mr. Masaru.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:29.700
Masaru will try to free Éléonore
from the rocket.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:34.120
-I can't undo it.
-Mr. Masaru, you must run.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.170
No! I could never leave you.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.800
But we'll both be taken up
to the space station.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.170
I don't care.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.260
I'll gladly go anywhere with you.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:54.060
How about it? Perfect, huh Gryphon?

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.230
Damn it, he's going to get his way!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.520
-Gosh damn it!
-Shut up.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:02.990
Let's go then, me.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.280
Yes, let's go me.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.530
Éléonore awaits.

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.120
You lowly animals!

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:21.210
Sangre y Fuego!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.760
Gorgon! Cerberus!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.670
This way, little girl.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.560
Unicorn...

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.310
Poor stupid girl.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:42.520
You thought you could beat me
with just these animals?

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.030
A-Arlequino?

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:57.160
Are you the loser puppet
that won't harm humans?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.750
It is Lady Francine's orders.
I am just obeying her.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:05.920
Young girl. Why do you fight?
Do you wish to die?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.010
-No, I...
-Stand back.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.230
Not bad for an antique.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.560
An honor.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.330
So this is the famous
Les Mains Scarlatines?

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.540
Hardly even warm.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.830
Tornado kick!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.040
Iron fist!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.080
Thunderclap strike!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.800
Les... Mains...

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.140
You knew this would happen.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.930
Why did you challenge me?

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.810
The old will always be driven out
by the new.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.980
Accept this and perish.
It will be more beautiful that way.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.240
The beauty of perishing, you say?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:16.950
I once said something like that
to a human.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:20.660
But that human denied it.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.670
He said it is not dying
that is beautiful.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:29.510
It is accepting your existence,
even while knowing you will die.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.630
That is where the true beauty lies.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.720
Who was that human?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.140
Narumi Kato.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.730
He's stronger than you.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.480
That name again.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.060
Enough.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.610
Basilisk!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:52.700
It's almost lift-off time.
Stay here and we'll be incinerated.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:56.620
Fine. This fight must be postponed.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.830
But I will defeat you.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:04.040
And after you, Narumi Kato.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:13.010
Countdown in progress.
20 minutes until lift-off.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:21.480
It's no use.
Faceless is going to take me to space.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:26.860
No! I didn't care for my life before.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:30.400
But now that I've met them...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.820
Mr. Masaru.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.160
And Narumi Kato.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.200
I must do something.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.540
You've done well
with that small body of yours.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.290
But I'm keeping Éléonore.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.040
I won't let you!

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.960
Mr. Masaru, Faceless!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.590
Dismantle!

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:56.680
That's my move. It won't work on me.

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.800
But I bet you don't know this.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.060
Mr. Masaru!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:15.360
Countdown in progress.
15 minutes until lift-off.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.990
Éléonore, my bride.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.870
The boy has finally come this far.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.160
Just to save you.

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
Let go of him!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.920
No can do.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:32.880
You're going to watch him die.

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.760
So you have nothing left on Earth
that you desire.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.640
Shirogane...

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.850
I couldn't download myself into him.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.940
He resisted, you see.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:50.860
My plan to take over his brain
to get close to you has failed.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.530
Fine, whatever you say!
Just don't hurt him.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.530
Please...

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:03.290
It's perfect. Éléonore believes it.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:07.710
That I haven't downloaded myself
into Masaru's brain.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:15.880
But the real me has been downloaded
into this boy.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.590
All that's left is for
the old me to lose on purpose.

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.520
13 minutes until lift-off.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.320
I do not fear death.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.320
Nor do I mean to die.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:41.490
The new me will carry on the baton.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:46.080
And finally gain the love I once lost.

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.330
I can't wait!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.220
He was so close.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.180
I'll set you free.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.730
Damn it, I dodged by mistake. My reflexes.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:15.940
This body still yearns to live, huh?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.990
Hey, what the heck are you doing?

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.740
Yeah, why did I dodge him?

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.990
It was the perfect chance.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.830
But that face just now...

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:39.920
I'm overthinking it.
I've never had two bodies before.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:46.600
Even if we think alike, I don't know
what the other me is thinking right now.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:52.770
Okay, I'll let him really get me
this time.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.980
Die, Faceless!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.320
Now.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.900
This is it.

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.620
Masaru will dismantle me.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.990
And then...

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:19.090
What...?

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.050
It can't be...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.580
What are you doing here?

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.550
This is my room now.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.720
Why are you still here?

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.640
Masaru.

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:25.150
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:29.910
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.580
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:39.460
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:44.010
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:48.890
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:53.720
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:58.400
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:03.400
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:08.030
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:12.660
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:17.410
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:22.460
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:30.390
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:34.390
The melody that brought you here
